    "text": "At $25^{\\circ} \\mathrm{C}$, the solubility produet of salt of $\\mathrm{MX}_{2}$ type is $3.2 \\times 10^{-8}$ in water. The solubility (in $\\mathrm{mol} / \\mathrm{L})$ of $M X_{2}$ in water at the sume temperature will be",
